1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:52,890
Sea of Devils

25
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:59,890
It's said that many Spirit Beasts live in the Sea of Devils.

26
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,650
Most cultivators here don't follow common sense

27
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,170
and only value strength...

28
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,610
Also...

29
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,450
there are very few women.

30
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,930
Once a woman is discovered,

31
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,490
terrible things will happen to her

32
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:11,290
unless she has powerful backing.

33
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,050
She is mine !

34
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,650
Senior !

35
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,210
Come out !

36
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,490
How dare you !

37
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,010
Middle stage Foundation Establishment ?

38
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,090
There are 3 of them !

39
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,650
Senior,

40
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,090
let's retreat.

41
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,770
Brat,

42
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:09,570
this is the territory of the Fighting Evil Sect.

43
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,730
If you're smart,

44
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:12,730
then leave that female to us.

45
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,290
Otherwise...

46
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,290
Nonsense... Die !

47
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,690
They...

48
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,450
How ?

49
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,890
Didn't you say that cultivators here don't follow reason

50
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,890
and only value strength ?

51
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,650
What you just used...

52
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,890
was it the Death Spell ?

53
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,690
The Death Spell ?

54
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,850
I once read in the Luo River Sect's scripture pavilion

55
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,410
that a vicious spell

56
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,890
of the demonic path existed in ancient times.

57
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,130
Cultivating it

58
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,490
required merging 3 energies.

59
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,450
The first energy was yin energy

60
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,290
by using a woman's Primordial Yin

61
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,290
Note: Primordial Yin = virginity

62
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,130
through dual cultivation.

63
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,010
The second energy was death energy.

64
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,850
The third was killing intent.

65
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,370
Merge these 3 energies

66
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,730
and escape death 9 times

67
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,730
to master the Death Spell.

68
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:15,330
The chance of succeeding

69
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,690
is almost zero.

70
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,570
It's really similar...

71
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,290
This Death Spell

72
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,210
is likely an imitation of the Ji Realm.

73
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:26,490
It's perfect for concealing the Ji Realm's existence.

74
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,090
Once the Heaven Separating Pill is refined

75
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,410
and I reach Core Formation,

76
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:33,010
I will let you leave.

77
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,730
But if you think of escaping...

78
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,250
don't blame me !

79
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,930
This guy

80
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:43,530
is even more terrifying than cultivators of the Sea of Devils.

81
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,650
An abandoned cave ?

82
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,850
The mountains in the Sea of Devils

83
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,370
are hard to excavate.

84
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,090
Let's find another place.

85
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,130
His Divine Sense

86
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:24,450
can control over 30 flying swords simultaneously !

87
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,250
This formation is pretty ordinary.

88
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,490
It can only resist Foundation Establishment cultivators.

89
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,770
I plan to stay in this cave long-term.

90
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,730
If the formation is broken,

91
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,490
I can easily escape.

92
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:02,290
But you will have to rely on yourself.

93
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:54,650
Note: The Eight Chinese Trigrams have various different meanings in Feng Shui.

94
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,850
Qian: Triple lines

95
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,970
Kun: Six fragments

96
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,610
Zhen: Upside bowl

97
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,730
Gen: Downside bowl

98
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,850
Li: Hollow bowl

99
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,810
Kan: Full bowl

100
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,490
Dui: Open top

101
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,650
Xun: Open bottom

102
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,810
3 hours later

103
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,890
There are now 214 formations.

104
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,490
I used bones of crystal beasts

105
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,970
to make the Nine Bones Formation.

106
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,170
The formation is only at 30% power.

107
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,010
To make it stronger,

108
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,490
we need more bones.

109
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,010
You first...

110
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,210
Judging by this cave's condition,

111
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:05,290
a cultivator was here before us.

112
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,130
Senior,

113
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:12,090
should I refine the Heaven Separating Pill now ?

114
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,970
I won't consume

115
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,410
the pills you make.

116
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,610
Senior saved my life.

117
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,330
How can I earn your trust ?

118
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,330
You need to give me your Soul Blood.

119
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,170
But I won't make it too difficult for you.

120
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:28,050
Just refine enough pills for me

121
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,810
to reach Core Formation.

122
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,010
Once I'm done,

123
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,370
I'll escort you out of the Sea of Devils.

124
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,250
Here are the materials I have,

125
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:49,130
see what you can refine with that.

126
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:55,210
This...

127
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,410
this is Desolate Wood Root,

128
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:58,050
and Yellow Core Grass...

129
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,170
Heaven Spirit Grass !

130
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,890
Senior,

131
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,890
I can freely use all these materials ?

132
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,650
Right ?

133
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,170
I only want pills.

134
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,090
As for the process,

135
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,890
you can do whatever you wish.

136
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,410
Senior can rest assured.

137
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:12,850
With these materials,

138
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,850
I can refine

139
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,770
approximately 300 Yellow Spirit Pills,

140
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,890
50 Poison Resistance Pills,

141
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,970
and various other pills.

142
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,050
Senior,

143
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,370
look at this Demon Blood Vine.

144
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:24,010
It used to be the core ingredient of the Heaven Separating Pill.

145
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,210
However,

146
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,050
refining the pills will take considerable time.

147
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,170
The Nine Bones Formation

148
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,490
probably won't last that long.

149
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,530
I plan on making a trip outside

150
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,650
to look for more bones for the formation.

151
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,970
I'll come back

152
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,010
in 3 days, maybe a week.

153
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,770
The artifact crafting technique of the War God Shrine

154
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:43,170
also requires Spirit Beast skulls for reaction furnaces.

155
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,970
Senior...

156
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,490
Could you

157
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,170
also find me a pill furnace ?

158
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,250
The pill furnace I carry can only refine ordinary pills.

159
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,570
Usually, Heaven Separating Pills

160
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:58,290
were refined in the sect's Heaven Fusing Furnace.

161
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,930
According to the map,

162
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,970
I should be able to find bones around here.

163
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:25,610
Sang Muya
Fighting Evil Sect disciple
15th layer of Qi Condensation

164
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,170
I painstakingly prepared

165
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:29,050
these 16 deadly poisons.

166
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:30,650
Senior Brother,

167
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:32,410
you're not young anymore.

168
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,770
why don't you help your Junior Brother

169
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,530
by letting me use Foundation Stealing

170
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,810
to devour you !

171
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,690
Sang Muya,

172
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,530
you bastard !

173
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,570
aren't you afraid of Master ?

174
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,650
I'm just following the tradition

175
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,210
of the Fighting Evil Sect.

176
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:50,050
Master has already tacitly approved.

177
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,490
I had my Divine Sense

178
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,890
spread out to scan the area

179
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:14,490
but I didn't detect him...

180
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,330
Junior Sang Muya of the Fighting Evil Sect

181
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,210
greets Senior.

182
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,810
I didn't know Senior was here,

183
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:21,010
how can I help you ?

184
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,950
Where did you

185
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:33,090
find your beast bones ?

186
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,170
Senior,

187
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,650
we were in the outskirts of the Sea of Devils.

188
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:40,730
I'm taking you

189
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,170
to a more central area

190
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,890
were there are more Spirit Beasts

191
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,290
and thus more bones.

192
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,530
He probably isn't lying.

193
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,930
Senior,

194
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,570
the Sea of Devils

195
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,810
has 3 very dangerous areas.

196
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,810
This Corpse Valley

197
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:58,050
is one of them.

198
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,530
Spirit beasts often come here.

199
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:04,090
New corpses of beasts are found here regularly.

200
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,530
But we don't know

201
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,770
what killed them.

202
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,410
This must be the place.

203
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,930
Now die !

204
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,290
There are hundreds of souls in that flag.

205
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,890
I guess I can feed them to Xu Liguo.

206
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,810
The quality of the bones is too poor.

207
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,570
I guess I need to explore a bit more.

208
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:58,610
Even if the bones here aren't top quality,

209
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,290
they can still strengthen

210
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,530
the Nine Bones Formation.

211
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:04,290
It seems like yin energy is gathering here too.

212
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,530
This valley

213
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:07,530
is completely different from the previous one.

214
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,770
Although it appears calm,

215
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,770
it's one of the most dangerous places

216
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:13,210
in the Sea of Devils.

217
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,690
There must be some kind of danger here.

218
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,530
This is...

219
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,850
a Flood Dragon !

220
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,530
This Flood Dragon

221
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,890
is probably even stronger

222
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:49,650
than a Nascent Soul cultivator.

223
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,010
You're mine !

224
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:03,530
10 days later

225
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,730
He said 3 days

226
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,770
but it's already been 10...

227
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:21,970
Open the formation.

228
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,330
Will the bones

229
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,010
of this Flood Dragon be enough

230
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:35,970
for the formation ?

231
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,250
Yes.

232
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,370
With Flood Dragon bones

233
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,810
the formation

234
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:42,770
will resist Core Formation cultivators for days.

235
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,730
Even Nascent Soul cultivators will struggle.

236
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,450
This formation

237
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,530
can't be called the Nine Bones Formation anymore.

238
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,330
It should be...

239
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,970
the Nine Dragon Bones Formation !

240
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,170
Wait.

241
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:15,050
These are the Flood Dragon's Core and marrow.

242
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:16,610
The Core is a natural pill

243
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:18,010
and has healing properties.

244
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,370
The marrow is even more precious,

245
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,810
it's concentrated spiritual energy.

246
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,610
You can

247
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:35,010
leave the rest to me.

248
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:16,290
Grade 2
Earth Yin

249
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:17,210
Although it can't compare to

250
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,410
the Grade 4 Earth Yin in the Corpse Valley,

251
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:20,810
it's enough to cultivate.

252
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,930
the Underworld Ascension Method.

253
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,890
Now,

254
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,410
I need to prepare for Core Formation.

255
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,650
My second Cold Core condensed.

256
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:47,130
We'll see where you run off to this time.

257
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,370
I'm going out.

258
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:53,530
Senior, wait.

259
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:04,210
The Sea of Devils is dangerous

260
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,730
and Flood Dragon skin is resistant

261
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,650
and poison-proof.

262
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:09,090
I took the liberty of crafting it

263
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,330
so that Senior

264
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,330
may use it.

265
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:23,490
If Senior still doubts me,

266
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:26,050
you can throw it outside the cave

267
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:27,450
to strengthen the formation.

268
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,050
I just need one,

269
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:31,010
keep the other.

270
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:47,770
3 months later

271
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,850
Little Lin

272
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,330
The Ancestral meridian,

273
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,450
the Qi Sea

274
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:58,410
and the Dantian

275
00:18:58,160 --> 00:19:00,090
will each condense a Cold Core.

276
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:02,930
The Underworld Ascension Method merges the 3 Cold Cores.

277
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,450
After they've merged,

278
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:07,370
you have a chance to breakthrough to Core Formation

279
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:09,850
by forming your true Golden Core.

280
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,570
I still can't merge the Cold Cores...

281
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,930
I need to try harder.

282
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:24,050
Damn it !

283
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:38,730
Master, oh Master...

284
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:41,170
Normally, I can only appear when summoned.

285
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,050
But now that you're unconscious,

286
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:48,050
it seems my chance for freedom has finally come !

287
00:20:02,890 --> 00:20:08,780
I've been walking this path for endless years

288
00:20:05,190 --> 00:20:08,780
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

289
00:20:09,170 --> 00:20:14,380
Is it the compass of fate

290
00:20:11,010 --> 00:20:14,380
that wrote this outcome for us ?

291
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:20,300
The heavens want to erase your existence,

292
00:20:20,170 --> 00:20:26,020
that's the obsession guiding me.

293
00:20:26,050 --> 00:20:31,620
Is this the path to uncover

294
00:20:27,930 --> 00:20:31,620
truths from falsehoods ?

295
00:20:31,650 --> 00:20:37,220
In a world of murk and shadow,

296
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:37,220
only the flame of truth can light the way.

297
00:20:37,010 --> 00:20:42,940
Look at them all,

298
00:20:39,890 --> 00:20:42,940
being carried by the waves.

299
00:20:43,130 --> 00:20:47,580
Look at them all,

300
00:20:45,290 --> 00:20:47,580
being drowned.

301
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:50,900
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

302
00:20:50,690 --> 00:20:53,980
I will let the world refine my soul.

303
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:59,540
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

304
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:59,540
I will fight.

305
00:20:59,290 --> 00:21:02,660
I'll break through the abyss of despair

306
00:21:02,410 --> 00:21:05,700
to finally learn who I really am.

307
00:21:05,450 --> 00:21:11,060
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

308
00:21:07,330 --> 00:21:11,060
I embrace this obsession.

309
00:21:10,810 --> 00:21:14,020
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

310
00:21:13,770 --> 00:21:16,820
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

311
00:21:16,570 --> 00:21:22,300
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

312
00:21:18,610 --> 00:21:22,300
I'll still fight.

313
00:21:22,250 --> 00:21:25,660
It's hard to avoid loneliness

314
00:21:25,410 --> 00:21:28,700
when you are above everyone else.

315
00:21:28,450 --> 00:21:34,380
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

316
00:21:30,770 --> 00:21:34,380
be afraid of a firefly ?
